    "7.7.3"
  ],
  "description": "A withdrawal that targets a detection, a reconciliation (here an adopt_policy of the baseline) or a normalization is rejected under 10.2.6; so is a reconciliation with an empty target list. The story, its detection, the reconciliation and the normalization are unchanged.",
